invariant: INV-16
file: Makefile
catches: test/lint-trust-separation.sh
reason: a host object stops carrying the native copy of mlkem_poly.c, and its
  link fails on the _native names widemul.h calls only where something
  links it. lint-trust-separation's host rows require every file of
  WIDEMUL_COPIED beside its native copy.

--- old
WIDEMUL_COPIED := poly1305.c mlkem_poly.c rsa_sign.c
--- new
WIDEMUL_COPIED := poly1305.c rsa_sign.c
